    "full_text": "The core issue: ETH issuance currently has no ceiling. Proponents of a change argue the network is overpaying for security. Staking 60M ETH instead of 30M doesn't make the chain twice as safe; it just prints more ETH, creating deadweight loss that dilutes holders.",
